We received your report about the pool heater malfunction at the Riverside Community Center. I've contacted Pacific Mechanical to schedule a warranty service call.

Details from your report:
- Issue: Pool water temperature dropping below setpoint (82°F target, reading 74°F)
- First noticed: April 12, 2024
- Location: Mechanical room, Heater Unit #2 (Raypak 2100)

